  "cat:The life of women in 17th century Stokcholm\nJoin a tour in Stockholm during the Age of Great Power and meet some of the women who lived in the city at the time. What did they do for a living, and what opportunities did they have to make their voices heard in an era when women were expected to remain in the background? Maids and women boaters, noblewomen and widows, female writers and countesses all feature in this walking tour, which takes us from the heights of Södermalm to the narrow streets of Gamla Stan (the Old Town) in 17th-century Stockholm.": {
