  "cat:CITY WALK / SPY WALK - CASABLANCA OF THE NORTH\nDuring the Second World War, Stockholm was not a neutral capital.  It was one of Europe’s most active centres of espionage. On this tour, you will step into the hidden reality behind the façades of Östermalm – where diplomats, agents and covert networks operated in the shadows. You will visit the actual locations where this activity took place – including one of the most conspiratorial sites in the history of the world. You will also gain a deeper understanding of Sweden’s role in the war, beyond the simplified version often presented.": {
